Let me check what `_block_tag`, `_valid_attr`, and `_valid_end` contain to understand the scope of these regex changes:

```json
{
  "type": "tool",
  "tool": "search_code",
  "arguments": {
    "query": "_block_tag",
    "path": "mistune.py",
    "max_results": 5
  },
  "reason": "Find the definition of _block_tag to understand what HTML tags are affected"
}
```

Let me check the definitions of the related constants:

```json
{
  "type": "tool",
  "tool": "search_code",
  "arguments": {
    "query": "_inline_tags",
    "path": "mistune.py",
    "max_results": 5
  },
  "reason": "Find _inline_tags definition to understand what tags are excluded"
}
```

```json
{
  "type": "tool",
  "tool": "file_context",
  "arguments": {
    "path": "mistune.py",
    "line": 30,
    "radius": 10,
    "revision": "head"
  },
  "reason": "Get the full list of inline tags to understand the scope"
}
```
